erif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_gTXMK1-s4EOsKWmn_xm7UA" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfIncomeTaxExplanatory" id="Tb__fwe-zhynEKWe3HiJ8tCvA" continuedAt="Tb__fwe-zhynEKWe3HiJ8tCvA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">26.</b></span>Taxation</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">(a)</b></span>Income tax expense</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Income tax expense is recognized based on management&#8217;s best knowledge of the income tax rates expected for the financial&#160;year.</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(i)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Cayman Islands</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company is incorporated as an exempted company with limited liability under the Companies Act of the Cayman Islands and is not subject to tax on income or capital gains. Additionally, the Cayman Islands do not impose a withholding tax on payments of dividends to shareholders. The Cayman Islands are not party to any double tax treaties applicable to any payments made by or to the Company.</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(ii)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Hong Kong Profits Tax</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Entities incorporated in Hong Kong are subject to Hong Kong Profits Tax at a rate of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="Duration_3_31_2018_To_3_31_2018_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_country_HK_6rX_pdauJUmVt7LNXCdLrA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ApplicableTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_jx-KpMYzSECXCZ1a1QN5Sw">16.5</ix:nonFraction>% for assessable profits earned in Hong Kong before April 1, 2018. Starting from the financial year commencing on April 1, 2018, the two-tiered profits tax regime took effect, under which the tax rate is&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2018_To_4_1_2018_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_country_HK_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_naas_FirstHk2MillionMember_iigwu2tYDkSd4FgdV0aMVg" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ApplicableTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_KMb6nLvOz0-_-1Tmhe7fnQ">8.25</ix:nonFraction>% for assessable profits on the first HK$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_HKD_g-8G2sQ4IU-ydyDQ1xJUzQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2018_To_4_1_2018_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_country_HK_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_naas_FirstHk2MillionMember_iigwu2tYDkSd4FgdV0aMVg" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:AssessableProfits" scale="6" id="Narr_XCB27-WZR0uoALVJxnKEYg">2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2018_To_4_1_2018_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_country_HK_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_naas_ExcessOfHk2MillionMember_llj3f2sSB0iqfhzNNylSBg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ApplicableTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_C8Q8Q-8DrUShZpzeUsqSrw">16.5</ix:nonFraction>% for any assessable profits in excess of HK$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_HKD_g-8G2sQ4IU-ydyDQ1xJUzQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2018_To_4_1_2018_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_country_HK_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_naas_ExcessOfHk2MillionMember_llj3f2sSB0iqfhzNNylSBg" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:AssessableProfits" scale="6" id="Narr_r-RXQpX1EkuGPnXibsw-Kg">2</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million. </p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(iii)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">PRC Enterprise Income Tax (&#8220;EIT&#8221;)</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Group&#8217;s operations in the PRC are subject to EIT at a statutory tax rate of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_naas_PrcMember_qBuLKQraD0Srg8LgTRUBPw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:AverageEffectiveTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_VWBPBtcXFU2IegAqoFN16Q"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_naas_PrcMember_o2lu0ihC3U6xDqVAQDR4oQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:AverageEffectiveTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_mor_fpaQSESJVId7kiAAqA">25</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>% for assessable profits for the years ended December 31, 2023 and 2024, based on the existing legislation, interpretation and practices in respect thereof.</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(iv)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Withholding tax in Mainland China (&#8220;WHT&#8221;)</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Distribution of profits to foreign investors earned by companies in Mainland China since January 1, 2008 is subject to WHT at a rate of&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2018_To_1_1_2018_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember_n2h0mL0y_Um-Z5Yx4WVeyg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:WithholdingTax" scale="-2" id="Narr_4bySGHuVXUS_BElbCGipSw">5</ix:nonFraction>% or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2018_To_1_1_2018_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_TopOfRangeMember_K7ilmqmn3EWM5iB1ReqSPA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:WithholdingTax" scale="-2" id="Narr_jZseRsteak6lrZWyZEa3mw">10</ix:nonFraction>%, depending on the country of incorporation of the foreign investors.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-53</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">NAAS TECHNOLOGY INC</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES&#160;TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><a id="_d993b147_a52d_4c60_a9af_60e8ca7d396a"></a><a id="Tc_0vSsZU2sqEq3559viLUzTw_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_vNVHTonorEee4MPXGy-0_w_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_fJgOUgn8YEitFIzpqf3rLQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_jYn6hHhnk0OUZM4j_3-XWA_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_cocRNR_AEUef88hGq-ekvQ_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_EmorBQrEQ0uyDT9phWzVew_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_cmhPHp1ZUESXeAGho-JaDQ_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_16Pf1enPIEy2yOVRgXvUTg_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_KNpkNNKMtkuSp3el-qRClA_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_H7GR2p_t-UuKCOMqbOkyfg_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_tL_4inHDjE6eWmEnMF-BDw_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_ONwKVVceakipEy-LChzVhA_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_RlKFojn_SkS5u9ep2AXT7w_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_9QKHR6nl20ytOrgeBwBxbg_9_2"></a><a id="_39241ead_1190_4d8b_9ffb_ded6388889b7"></a><a id="Tc_pAx76XhLaUCmWXzsiqTWCw_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_OvAS_arW-02-Y76HMcMdEw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_RkfsiDtBsk68jZr0FmtYOQ_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_D7XojBrIxUmVcC9j2g391A_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_sMk6gD29ckiuzJwFrk-EAw_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_LGASYB5HNEGdmd5rleriug_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_sb-42_mSZ0mvbtWqTYtZAw_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_AsQ_sQX12UOZD9UWDTjOBg_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_1KTPiZNEIUCwWXSv3KlocQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_dRoZ-4O8q0Ssa1g1J1QlkQ_5_2"></a><a id="Tc_8DQ6Kn1W6kGKgqSiTiEu9w_6_0"></a><a id="Tc__pasc8bTvkKgYO_UWX3o9A_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_9LM8OAYhN0W2Zm3fFLaagg_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_vgYPvT0cNUyekv0NNKg0wg_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_CXVwpfbmT0eNxKqEV26-Lw_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_pfgcNrJZ90qlUP7VzaP59Q_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_csA2PJJi7Ey0VnekMuMP0A_12_2"></a><a id="Tc_OrI-2dDzLkK7IAISS8xNQQ_13_0"></a><a id="Tc_bEAuBQpIlE-81n52UPH1nQ_14_0"></a><a id="Tc_FN4gPyGczESZnd8G-a566Q_14_2"></a><a id="Tc_sS8e1MPvdEuj3WldzROk4w_14_6"></a><a id="Tc_JnHkPcClLkKzgXJ3B7yNGg_15_0"></a><a id="Tc_x2GHVFssQ0SZQ_XpuJysZQ_16_0"></a><a id="Tc_1T0ckJlYk0WTOwnX86vmSA_16_2"></a><a id="Tc_Gs4jPDbcrkWfhjsxRGpMIg_16_6"></a><a id="Tc_siS2HsksOk22f7ZlEvEoIA_17_0"></a><a id="Tc_8dREKizT50iI_OuB8gAZoQ_17_2"></a><a id="Tc_lo7vqEENZU6-0a0IAepEag_17_6"></a><a id="Tc_tGqQCsNGIkWWQ9LZlr38jA_18_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb__fwe-zhynEKWe3HiJ8tCvA_cont1" continuedAt="Tb__fwe-zhynEKWe3HiJ8tCvA_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Group did not plan to require its subsidiaries in Mainland China to distribute their retained earnings in the foreseeable future. Accordingly,&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_a5gxuVH8Y0a9uyImGkqFOQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="ifrs-full:DeferredTaxLiabilityAsset" scale="3" id="Narr_14RNQsKAp0uUB0H4XJYKJg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2024_8Hl4eTAz2UibicoE-XXWqg" decimals="-3" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="ifrs-full:DeferredTaxLiabilityAsset" scale="3" id="Narr_a6X9twp_C0GNZRDmUM4bJw">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>&#160;deferred tax liabilities in respect of WHT on undistributed earnings were recognized as of December 31, 2023 and 2024.</p><ix:nonNumeric con