 by the Controlling Shareholder</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:50.08%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_HuzhouZhidianlaileNewEnergyTechnologyCoLtdMember_UDHkVri2bU2QLqMA82Es-w" name="ifrs-full:NameOfParentEntity" id="Tc_7vIF_bCIlUCsQqfU_QdZyA_4_0">Huzhou Zhidianlaile New Energy Technology Co., Ltd.</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:1.53%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:48.37%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_HuzhouZhidianlaileNewEnergyTechnologyCoLtdMember_UDHkVri2bU2QLqMA82Es-w" name="ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfRelatedPartyRelationship" id="Tc_NlR6qdHG2k6FC4T1x2nphw_4_2">Significantly influenced by the Group</ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">(b)</b></span>Contribution from Controlling Shareholder</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the year ended December 31, 2024, Newlink paid a total of&#160;RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_wMvNkkA8nUeaplTdNf9hhQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:RelatedPartyPayrollAndNonpayrollLaborExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_JhFRNZ1VNku_x0qhpDKaZg">24.9</ix:nonFraction> million (2023: RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_I3dzkXR1_EacAGbWisyNJQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:RelatedPartyPayrollAndNonpayrollLaborExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_2TjDK2kDBE6ZdzJ90DLxaA">65.2</ix:nonFraction> million) on behalf of the Group, including (i) RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_wMvNkkA8nUeaplTdNf9hhQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LeasesAsLesseeRelatedPartyTransactions" scale="6" id="Narr_zH24iFeM-kOLnCz4NPFI8w">7.3</ix:nonFraction> million (2023: RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_I3dzkXR1_EacAGbWisyNJQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:LeasesAsLesseeRelatedPartyTransactions" scale="6" id="Narr_IHksggRrekmnF108TdaFOw">42.6</ix:nonFraction> million) of payroll and non-payroll labor expense; (ii)&#160;RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_wMvNkkA8nUeaplTdNf9hhQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:RelatedPartyOtherExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_276YPkDB20u-hfoTv_eYMg">2.5</ix:nonFraction> million (2023: RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_I3dzkXR1_EacAGbWisyNJQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:RelatedPartyOtherExpenses" scale="6" id="Narr_6umW_kNvXkixX2warofiDg">3.2</ix:nonFraction> million) of rental fees; and (iii) RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_wMvNkkA8nUeaplTdNf9hhQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:PaymentsMadeByRelatedPartyOnBehalfOfEntity" scale="6" id="Narr_1GxyNm0nMEiTRaNOtJ_nKg">15.1</ix:nonFraction> million (2023: RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_I3dzkXR1_EacAGbWisyNJQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:PaymentsMadeByRelatedPartyOnBehalfOfEntity" scale="6" id="Narr_jeBxfzKLckSQ-bnpfMo02w">19.4</ix:nonFraction> million) of other expenses, which were reflected in the consolidated statements of profit or loss and other comprehensive loss.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">(c)</b></span>Share-based compensation from controlling shareholder ESOP</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Newlink granted share options under Newlink 2020 Share Incentive Plan to certain employees associated with the Group&#8217;s charging services business, who were subsequently transferred to the Group. For the years ended December 31, 2023 and 2024, share-based compensation expense was debited to profit or loss for RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_ifrs-full_ComponentsOfEquityAxis_ifrs-full_AdditionalPaidinCapitalMember_LjaX28Awik2-rAmC3-giwQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:IncreaseDecreaseThroughSharebasedPaymentTransactions" scale="6" id="Narr_PivK4vc1Z0uJ2VcjLni0Kg">5.3</ix:nonFraction> million and credited to profit or loss for RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_naas_NewlinktechnologylimitedMember_ifrs-full_ComponentsOfEquityAxis_ifrs-full_AdditionalPaidinCapitalMember_N-NYwE3X50iHpDjiMjgbMQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:IncreaseDecreaseThroughSharebasedPaymentTransactions" scale="6" id="Narr_k5hyUoFVckutENLhYp_gTg">0.8</ix:nonFraction> million, with a corresponding increase and decrease in additional paid-in capital, respectively. See Note 28 for further details.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">(d)</b></span>Other transactions with related parties</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The following table provides the amount of energy solution revenues including discontinued operations arising from the transactions entered into with related parties in the ordinary course of the Group&#8217;s business during the years indicated:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_gTXMK1-s4EOsKWm