p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.91%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.13%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_h-5RiJIdRUWk_UP9KnsQKQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensationSharebasedPayment" scale="3" id="Tc_j2hczvHX1EyP8xR0KVbnSw_5_4">229,542</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.91%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.15%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_gTXMK1-s4EOsKWmn_xm7UA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensationSharebasedPayment" scale="3" id="Tc_s1DppFFRz02q2m8Tdtrwig_5_6">23,034</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:60.8%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.92%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.13%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_r0WZAwVVWUiAws7Vp25qcA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensation" scale="3" id="Tc_pksmtIjhjkubVbhpBLlMxg_6_2">126,077</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.91%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.13%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_h-5RiJIdRUWk_UP9KnsQKQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensation" scale="3" id="Tc_uyqiZ3_4tUGpmO8ju1Gmbw_6_4">237,010</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.91%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">&#160;</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:11.15%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_gTXMK1-s4EOsKWmn_xm7UA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensation" scale="3" id="Tc_zApW0rzltEyoo6Tlrr6YNw_6_6">27,522</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_gTXMK1-s4EOsKWmn_xm7UA" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfEventsAfterReportingPeriodExplanatory" id="Tb_EIW3L_GM_kaPPkes9xMORw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"><b style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">33.</b></span>Event occurring after the reporting period</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 28, 2025, the Group disposed of its other financial assets measured at amortized cost at an aggregate disposal value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_vynp2i_E2UmnONV-hluxMw" contextRef="As_Of_4_28_2025_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_OtherDisposalsOfAssetsMember_i2VdnlJbZ0Okp0pvScHhtA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:DisposalOfFinancialAssetsMeasuredAtAmortizedCost" scale="6" id="Narr_uC9b9ybGZE-zGveh8EvH1g">1.3</ix:nonFraction> million. Loss allowance of RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_0qCbWPYWEEK2xacD2l1cCw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_OtherDisposalsOfAssetsMember_s9FZHQvoCEqa9Dlb5kSWKQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:LossAllowanceOnFinancialAssetsMeasuredAtAmortisedCost" scale="6" id="Narr_UrNj7N6bqUGXQDcHvYiVzA">232.9</ix:nonFraction> million (US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_vynp2i_E2UmnONV-hluxMw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_OtherDisposalsOfAssetsMember_s9FZHQvoCEqa9Dlb5kSWKQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:LossAllowanceOnFinancialAssetsMeasuredAtAmortisedCost" scale="6" id="Narr_yPiB5hJtSk6GwnNTBP7pUA">32.5</ix:nonFraction> million) was recognized in the consolidated statements of profit or loss and other comprehensive loss for the year ended December 31, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On June 4, 2025, a Deed of Settlement (the &#8220;Deed&#8221;) was entered into by and among the Company, LMR and certain other parties, pursuant to which the parties have agreed to resolve the disputes arising from the Company&#8217;s failure to pay for obligations under the US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_vynp2i_E2UmnONV-hluxMw" contextRef="As_Of_6_4_2025_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_ifrs-full_ConvertibleInstrumentsMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_EnteringIntoSignificantCommitmentsOrContingentLiabilitiesMember_Vx6LBqhmDk2QBOf5qet2Iw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:DebtSecurities" scale="6" id="Narr_kbL9Kuy7O0iuMXFGMHz41A">35</ix:nonFraction> million convertible note issued on October 16, 2024, and related interest and cash consideration. Pursuant to the Deed, among other things, the Company has made an initial repayment of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_vynp2i_E2UmnONV-hluxMw" contextRef="Duration_6_4_2025_To_6_4_2025_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_ifrs-full_ConvertibleInstrumentsMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_EnteringIntoSignificantCommitmentsOrContingentLiabilitiesMember_3So0vvOOGkuFenBHKL_--g" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:RepaymentsOfBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities" scale="6" id="Narr_V9m-APlOpkC_faB9ZjV5Mg">1.5</ix:nonFraction> million and will pay an aggregate amount of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_vynp2i_E2UmnONV-hluxMw" contextRef="As_Of_6_4_2025_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_ifrs-full_ConvertibleInstrumentsMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_EnteringIntoSignificantCommitmentsOrContingentLiabilitiesMember_Vx6LBqhmDk2QBOf5qet2Iw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:Borrowings" scale="6" id="Narr_hDddAjDsn0yJiOdMmVDCWw">15</ix:nonFraction> million in <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_installment_XgPJOFbHZ0qTxPdiaLF7FQ" contextRef="Duration_6_4_2025_To_6_4_2025_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_ifrs-full_ConvertibleInstrumentsMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_EnteringIntoSignificantCommitmentsOrContingentLiabilitiesMember_3So0vvOOGkuFenBHKL_--g" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="naas:DebtInstrumentTermRepaymentNumberOfMonthlyInstallments" scale="0" id="Narr_rdT-B45c-0euyVB8wsHIXQ">twenty-four</ix:nonFraction> monthly installments commencing from June 25, 2025. The Company also agreed to issue to LMR a warrant exercisable at any time up to the 10th anniversary of the effective date of the Deed, entitling LMR to acquire no less than <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_D85r2EWBuUqsB_GqmC2vSw" contextRef="As_Of_6_4_2025_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_naas_IssueOfWarrantsMember_2Gtw7i4J4k2XEnJ7J1PPWQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:WarrantIssueMinimumAcquisitionOfIssuedShareCapitalPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_Uuy7X0R05ESx6bYYjUxpqQ">10</ix:nonFraction>% of the Company&#8217;s issued share capital if its market capitalization reaches US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_vynp2i_E2UmnONV-hluxMw" contextRef="As_Of_6_4_2025_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_naas_IssueOfWarrantsMember_2Gtw7i4J4k2XEnJ7J1PPWQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="naas:WarrantIssueMarketCapitalizationAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_I3F51CLPV0SIWz9FQVeYQw">90</ix:nonFraction> million, as calculated in accordance with the terms of the Deed. In consideration of the parties entering into the Deed and the full performance of each respective obligation by the obligors under the Deed, LMR has agreed to withdraw the winding-up petition filed in the Cayman Court against the Company and discontinue related arbitration proceedings.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-62</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;margin-left:5.88%;margin-right:5.88%;margin-top:30pt;page-break-after:avoid;width:88.24%;border:0;"></div><script type="text/javascript"  src="/NHfB/hR1N/z9/AfoF/hkPQ/D5VODVcwmV8VtphY/MBUmAQ/DVxoMFQ/ZWwQB"></script></body></html>
